<title>USA: BDM Federal, Lockheed win Defense contract.</title>
<headline>BDM Federal, Lockheed win Defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BDM International Inc said on Friday its subsidiary, BDM Federal Inc, and Lockheed Martin Service Co received a contract from the U.S. Department of Defense valued at up to  $81 million.</p>
<p>The company said BDM Federal was awarded a one-year contract with four one-year renewal options to support the Joint Readiness Training Center at Fort Polk, Louisiana.</p>
<p>With Lockheed, it will provide total mission support, including training requirements analysis, development strategies and training support packages.</p>
</text>
